le reference genes for gene expression studies in bovine muscular tissue</article-title><source>BMC Mol Biol</source><year>2008</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>79</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18786244</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2199-9-79</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Spinsanti</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Panti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Lazzeri</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Marsili</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Casini</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Frati</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Fossi</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Selection of reference genes for quantitative RT-PCR studies in striped dolphin (<italic>Stenella coeruleoalba</italic>) skin biopsies</article-title><source>BMC Mol Biol</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>32</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16984641</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2199-7-32</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scharlaken</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>de Graaf</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Goossens</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunain</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Peelman</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Jacobs</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reference gene selection for insect expression studies using quantitative real-time PCR: The head of the honeybee, <italic>Apis mellifera</italic>, after a bacterial challenge</article-title><source>Journal of Insect Science</source><year>2008</year><v